      "seconds": 0.323,
      "output": "CollatzCertificateLanguage.endpoint_congruence {n m y z : \u2115} {word : List \u2115} (hn : CollatzHighGapPump.Prefix n word y)\n  (hm : CollatzHighGapPump.Prefix m word z) : 3 ^ word.length \u2223 (\u2191y - \u2191z).natAbs\nCollatzCertificateLanguage.unbounded_repetition_fixed {word tail : List \u2115} (hne : word \u2260 [])\n  (all : \u2200 (k : \u2115), \u2203 n, CollatzWitness.Certificate n (CollatzCertificateLanguage.repeatWord word k ++ tail)) {x y : \u2115}\n  (hx : CollatzWitness.Certificate x (word ++ tail)) (hy : CollatzWitness.Certificate y tail) : x = y\nCollatzCertificateLanguage.pumping_erasure {u v w x y : List \u2115}\n  (all : \u2200 (k : \u2115), \u2203 n, CollatzWitness.Certificate n (CollatzCertificateLanguage.pumpedWord u v w x y k)) {k n : \u2115}\n  (hn : CollatzWitness.Certificate n (CollatzCertificateLanguage.pumpedWord u v w x y k)) :\n  CollatzWitness.Certificate n (u ++ w ++ y)\nCollatzCertificateLanguage.short_representative {L : List \u2115 \u2192 Prop} {N : \u2115}\n  (sound : \u2200 (word : List \u2115), L word \u2192 \u2203 n, CollatzWitness.Certificate n word)\n  (pumps : CollatzCertificateLanguage.PumpsAt L N) {n : \u2115} {word : List \u2115} (hw : L word)\n  (hn : CollatzWitness.Certificate n word) : \u2203 short, L short \u2227 CollatzWitness.Certificate n short \u2227 short.length < N\nCollatzCertificateLanguage.source_bound {L : List \u2115 \u2192 Prop} {M N : \u2115}\n  (sound : \u2200 (word : List \u2115), L word \u2192 \u2203 n, CollatzWitness.Certificate n word)\n  (pumps : CollatzCertificateLanguage.PumpsAt L N) (gaps : \u2200 (word : List \u2115), L word \u2192 \u2200 (a : \u2115), a \u2208 word \u2192 a \u2264 M)\n  {n : \u2115} {word : List \u2115} (hw : L word) (hn : CollatzWitness.Certificate n word) : n \u2264 2 ^ (M * N)\nCollatzCertificateLanguage.powered_source_bound {L : List \u2115 \u2192 Prop} {M N E e : \u2115}\n  (sound : \u2200 (word : List \u2115), L word \u2192 \u2203 n, CollatzWitness.Certificate n word)\n  (pumps : CollatzCertificateLanguage.PumpsAt L N) (gaps : \u2200 (word : List \u2115), L word \u2192 \u2200 (a : \u2115), a \u2208 word \u2192 a \u2264 M)\n  {n : \u2115} {word : List \u2115} (hw : L word) (hn : CollatzWitness.Certificate n word) (he : e \u2264 E) :\n  2 ^ e * n \u2264 2 ^ (E + M * N)\nCollatzCertificateLanguage.not_cofinal_sources {L : List \u2115 \u2192 Prop} {M N : \u2115}\n  (sound : \u2200 (word : List \u2115), L word \u2192 \u2203 n, CollatzWitness.Certificate n word)\n  (pumps : CollatzCertificateLanguage.PumpsAt L N) (gaps : \u2200 (word : List \u2115), L word \u2192 \u2200 (a : \u2115), a \u2208 word \u2192 a \u2264 M) :\n  \u00ac\u2200 (B : \u2115), \u2203 n word, B < n \u2227 L word \u2227 CollatzWitness.Certificate n word\n'CollatzCertificateLanguage.endpoint_congruence' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\n'CollatzCertificateLanguage.unbounded_repetition_fixed' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\n'CollatzCertificateLanguage.pumping_erasure' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\n'CollatzCertificateLanguage.short_representative' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\n'CollatzCertificateLanguage.source_bound' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\n'CollatzCertificateLanguage.powered_source_bound' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\n'CollatzCertificateLanguage.not_cofinal_sources' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\n"
